00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.450
But you can imagine that
if the Secretary of Defense

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:51.030
is urging the president not
to use troops in this context,

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.770
that it's not surprising that people

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:55.550
are going to protest the
use of this kind of force,

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:59.160
in addition to protesting
the police brutality

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:00.690
that we've seen throughout the country.

